---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Medical, Affiliate & FDA Disclaimers" description="Full legal disclaimers: medical advice, affiliate relationships, FDA supplement statements, and content accuracy." publishedDate="2026-08-08" lastReviewed="2026-08-08">
  <Header currentPath="/disclaimer" slot="header" />
  <Footer slot="footer" />

  <section class="py-12 md:py-20" aria-labelledby="disclaimer-title">
    <div class="container max-w-4xl">
      <header class="mb-12">
        <h1 id="disclaimer-title" class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-charcoal mb-4">
          Disclaimers & Disclosures
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-text leading-relaxed">
          Transparency matters. Here's the legal fine print in plain English.
        </p>
      </header>

      <article class="prose prose-lg prose-charcoal max-w-none space-y-10">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal mb-4">🏥 Medical Disclaimer</h2>
          <div class="card card-bordered bg-red/5 border-red/30 p-6 mb-6">
            <p class="text-text leading-relaxed mb-3"><strong>The content on this website is for informational and educational purposes only and does not constitute medical advice.</strong></p>
            <p class="text-text leading-relaxed mb-3">
              We are not physicians, optometrists, or licensed healthcare providers. Nothing on this site, articles, product recommendations, guides, or comments, creates a doctor-patient relationship.
              The information here is based on publicly available research, clinical guidelines, and FDA labeling, but it cannot replace a personalized examination by a licensed eye care professional.
            </p>
            <p class="text-text leading-relaxed mb-3">
              <strong>Always consult your ophthalmologist or optometrist before:</strong>
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-text leading-relaxed" role="list">
              <li>Starting any supplement (including AREDS2, omega-3, vitamins)</li>
              <li>Using any eye drop, lid hygiene product, or over-the-counter treatment</li>
              <li>Making lifestyle changes for an eye condition</li>
              <li>Delaying or discontinuing prescribed treatment</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-text leading-relaxed mt-3">
              <strong>If you experience any of the following, seek immediate medical attention:</strong>
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-text leading-relaxed" role="list">
              <li>Sudden onset of many new floaters, flashes of light, or a curtain/shadow in your vision</li>
              <li>Sudden vision loss, distortion (wavy lines), or a central blind spot</li>
              <li>Severe eye pain, especially with nausea, vomiting, or halos around lights</li>
              <li>Chemical splash, foreign body, or trauma to the eye</li>
              <li>Sudden double vision, droopy eyelid, or unequal pupils</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-text leading-relaxed mt-3">
              These can indicate retinal detachment, acute angle-closure glaucoma, stroke, or other vision-threatening emergencies where hours matter.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal mb-4">💰 Affiliate Disclosure (FTC Compliance)</h2>
          <div class="card card-bordered bg-blue/5 border-blue/30 p-6 mb-6">
            <p class="text-text leading-relaxed mb-3">
              <strong>We participate in affiliate advertising programs.</strong> When you click certain links on this site and make a purchase,
              we may earn a small commission at <strong>no additional cost to you.</strong>
            </p>
            <p class="text-text leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Current affiliate relationships include (but are not limited to):
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-text leading-relaxed" role="list">
              <li>Amazon Associates Program</li>
              <li>Direct brand partnerships (e.g., Nordic Naturals, PRN, OcuSoft)</li>
              <li>Retailer programs (Walmart, Target, CVS, Walgreens, etc.)</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-text leading-relaxed mt-3">
              Affiliate links are marked with <code>rel="noopener sponsored"</code> and <code>target="_blank"</code> attributes.
              Product recommendations are made <strong>before</strong> affiliate relationships are considered, based solely on:
            </p>
            <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-2 text-text leading-relaxed" role="list">
              <li>Clinical evidence for the ingredient/form/dose</li>
              <li>Third-party testing verification</li>
              <li>Label accuracy and bioavailability</li>
              <li>Value for money</li>
            </ol>
            <p class="text-text leading-relaxed mt-3">
              If a product is reformulated, discontinued, or a better option emerges, we update our recommendations regardless of affiliate status.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal mb-4">🏷️ FDA Supplement Disclaimer</h2>
          <div class="card card-bordered bg-amber/5 border-amber/30 p-6 mb-6">
            <p class="text-text leading-relaxed mb-3">
              <strong>Dietary supplements are not drugs.</strong> The U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) evaluates supplements differently than prescription or over-the-counter medications:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-text leading-relaxed" role="list">
              <li>Supplements do <strong>not</strong> require FDA pre-market approval for safety or efficacy</li>
              <li>Manufacturers are responsible for ensuring their products are safe and accurately labeled</li>
              <li>FDA can take action <strong>after</strong> a product reaches market if it's adulterated, misbranded, or makes illegal disease claims</li>
              <li>Structure/function claims (e.g., "supports eye health") are permitted with a disclaimer; disease claims (e.g., "treats macular degeneration") are <strong>illegal</strong> for supplements</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-text leading-relaxed mt-3">
              <strong>Standard FDA disclaimer (required on supplement labels):</strong>
            </p>
            <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-amber pl-4 my-4 text-text italic">
              "These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."
            </blockquote>
            <p class="text-text leading-relaxed">
              We only recommend supplements with clinical trial data (e.g., AREDS2 formula for intermediate AMD, rTG omega-3 for MGD).
              We do <strong>not</strong> endorse products that make illegal disease-treatment claims.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal mb-4">🔬 Content Accuracy & Evidence Standards</h2>
          <div class="card card-bordered bg-green/5 border-green/30 p-6 mb-6">
            <p class="text-text leading-relaxed mb-3">
              We strive for accuracy, but science evolves. Here's how we handle it:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-text leading-relaxed" role="list">
              <li><strong>Citations:</strong> We link to PubMed (PMID), DOIs, or major society guidelines (AAO, TFOS, AREDS) so you can verify.</li>
              <li><strong>Updates:</strong> We review condition pages quarterly and product recommendations quarterly. Last verified dates are shown on product cards.</li>
              <li><strong>Corrections:</strong> If you find an error, <a href="mailto:corrections@floatersfocus.org" class="text-primary hover:underline">email us</a>. We'll investigate and update with a correction note.</li>
              <li><strong>Conflicts:</strong> Our only revenue is affiliate commissions. We accept no sponsorships, paid placements, or manufacturer funding for content.</li>
              <li><strong>Limitations:</strong> We summarize research; we don't conduct it. Abstracts may not reflect full study nuance. Individual responses vary.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal mb-4">🔒 Privacy & Data</h2>
          <div class="card card-bordered p-6 mb-6">
            <p class="text-text leading-relaxed mb-3">
              <strong>We collect minimal data:</strong>
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-text leading-relaxed" role="list">
              <li>Email addresses (only if you voluntarily subscribe to our newsletter via Netlify Forms)</li>
              <li>Anonymous analytics via privacy-friendly Plausible/Umami (no cookies, no personal data)</li>
              <li>Standard server logs (IP, user agent, referrer) for security and debugging</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-text leading-relaxed mt-3">
              We do <strong>not</strong> sell, rent, or share your data. Email addresses are used only for the newsletter you opted into.
              Unsubscribe link in every email. See our <a href="/privacy" class="text-primary hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a> for details.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal mb-4">📅 Last Updated</h2>
          <p class="text-text leading-relaxed">
            These disclaimers were last reviewed and updated on <strong>July 12, 2026</strong>.
            We review them annually or when regulations change.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal mb-4">❓ Questions?</h2>
          <p class="text-text leading-relaxed">
            If something here is unclear, or you have a concern about our content or practices,
            please contact us at <a href="mailto:legal@floatersfocus.org" class="text-primary hover:underline">legal@floatersfocus.org</a>.
            We take transparency seriously.
          </p>
        </section>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>